---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Rewild" description="Meet Ewa, your guide at Rewild - grounded in nature, rooted in practice.">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <Nav />

  <!-- About -->
  <section class="bg-white pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest/60 hover:text-forest transition-colors duration-200 mb-12">
        <span>←</span><span>Home</span>
      </a>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24 items-stretch">
        <div class="md:order-1 min-h-[400px]">
          <img
            src="/images/eva.jpg"
            alt="Ewa"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-2">
          <div class="space-y-6 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              Hey, I'm Ewa.
            </p>
            <p>
              I teach nature based movement at Rewild.
            </p>
            <p>
              My background is in slalom skiing, trail running, mountain biking, swimming, martial arts and basketball.
            </p>
            <p>
              An early life exposure to a range of disciplines gave me a practical understanding of the body and preserved a child-like passion for adventure, movement, and nature.
            </p>
            <p>
              Born and raised in the mountains of southern Poland, I left for the UK in the mid-90s.
            </p>
            <p>
              There I studied physical education and was introduced to Ashtanga and Iyengar yoga, and pilates.
            </p>
            <p>
              I obtained yoga teacher certification in Hatha yoga in London and Advanced Trauma-Informed Academy certification with Nordic Maha Yoga, Oslo.
            </p>
            <p>
              Then, to cut the story short...
            </p>
            <p>
              Somewhere in the south of Norway, on the mountains covered in glittery snow, Rewild was being born.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 md:gap-24 mt-10 md:mt-16">
        <div class="md:order-2 md:mt-24">
          <img
            src="/images/firesmoke.jpg"
            alt="Fire smoke"
            class="w-full h-auto"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-1">
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-forest mb-10 leading-tight">
            The story of Rewild
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              As for many of us, at some point the intensity of challenges in life left me injured and burnt out.
            </p>
            <p>
              Work felt toxic.
            </p>
            <p>
              My heart was in constant physical pain from accumulated stress and emotions.
            </p>
            <p>
              I felt trapped and isolated.
            </p>
            <p>
              Intuitively, I began to run up on local mountains after work.
            </p>
            <p>
              As if to grasp for air while suffocating.
            </p>
            <p>
              In all weather, every season.
            </p>
            <p>
              I welcomed the elements as a gateway out of my mind into presence.
            </p>
            <p>
              Not a human for kilometers.
            </p>
            <p>
              Sometimes hiking up in deep snow.
            </p>
            <p>
              It was not easy.
            </p>
            <p>
              My lungs working hard to keep me moving.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every part of my body coming online.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every cell filling with life.
            </p>
            <p>
              With each breath, tensions releasing.
            </p>
            <p>
              Immersing in nature with all of my senses.
            </p>
            <p>
              Inside, spaces inhabited by stress and heaviness were cleared.
            </p>
            <p>
              Then refilled with the energy of the pure environment.
            </p>
            <p>
              Even though physically challenging, the trips became addictive.
            </p>
            <p>
              Each left me with joy, peace and deep appreciation of being alive.
            </p>
            <p>
              In awe of the incredible beauty of nature.
            </p>
            <p>
              Singing while walking home.
            </p>
            <p>
              The effects lingered.
            </p>
            <p>
              My capacity to deal with stress in daily life expanded.
            </p>
            <p>
              My perspective shifted.
            </p>
            <p>
              Resilience increased.
            </p>
            <p>
              I was wildly inspired to share these tools with the world.
            </p>
            <p>
              This turned out to be the very first, organic form of the <a href="/evening-reset" class="underline decoration-forest/40 hover:decoration-forest transition-colors duration-200">Evening Reset</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Now more refined, accessible, and constantly evolving.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Events -->
  <section id="events" class="bg-cream pt-10 pb-24 md:pt-36 md:pb-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-forest mb-10 font-light">Events</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-16 md:gap-8">

        <!-- Evening Reset -->
        <a href="/evening-reset" class="bg-white group overflow-hidden block cursor-pointer">
          <div class="overflow-hidden h-72">
            <img
              src="/images/skolapparn.jpg"
              alt="Evening Reset - forest hike"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sage mb-3 font-light">Hike & movement</p>
            <h3 class="font-display font-light text-3xl text-forest mb-5 leading-tight">Evening Reset</h3>
            <p class="text-forest font-light text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed mb-8">
              A weekly evening hike designed to help you release stress, build core strength, and move with greater awareness. Explore a new trail each week, in all weather and every season.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-5 border-t border-cream">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest group-hover:text-sage transition-colors duration-300">
                Learn more →
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Deep Rest -->
        <a href="/deep-rest" class="bg-white group overflow-hidden block cursor-pointer">
          <div class="overflow-hidden h-72">
            <img
              src="/images/moss.jpg"
              alt="Deep Rest - guided relaxation"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sage mb-3 font-light">Guided relaxation</p>
            <h3 class="font-display font-light text-3xl text-forest mb-5 leading-tight">Deep Rest</h3>
            <p class="text-forest font-light text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed mb-8">
              A guided relaxation journey, helping you release tension after an intense day or high-activity period. Followed by a nourishing soup. Small groups, cosy atmosphere.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-5 border-t border-cream">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest group-hover:text-sage transition-colors duration-300">Learn more →</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Nordkollen Rewild Trip -->
        <a href="/nordkollen-rewild-trip" class="bg-white group overflow-hidden block cursor-pointer">
          <div class="overflow-hidden h-72">
            <img
              src="/images/trees.jpg"
              alt="Nordkollen Rewild Trip - full-day hike"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sage mb-3 font-light">Day trip</p>
            <h3 class="font-display font-light text-3xl text-forest mb-5 leading-tight">Nordkollen Rewild</h3>
            <p class="text-forest font-light text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed mb-8">
              A longer, wilder, daytime hike that takes you deeper into your core, movement and breath awareness. Expanded nature immersion with more time to be, sense and connect.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-5 border-t border-cream">
              <span class="inline-block text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest group-hover:text-sage transition-colors duration-300">
                Learn more →
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-forest text-white py-14 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center">
      <p class="text-white/30 text-xs font-light">© 2025 Rewild</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>
